  "title": "Florida Adjutant General Visits Florida National Guard Soldiers Supporting Flood Response Efforts",
  "description": "The Adjutant General of Florida, Maj. Gen. John D. Haas, met with Florida Army National Guard Soldiers with 1st Battalion, 265th Air Defense Artillery Regiment supporting flood response efforts at the Brevard County Emergency Operations Center and the Brevard County Fire Rescue Center in Rockledge, Florida, Nov. 21, 2026.\n\nWe have forces operating throughout the affected region, providing assistance to the areas of greatest need. (U.S. Army Video by Staff Sgt. Marc Morgenstern, 107th MPAD)",
